flowchart LR
  User[Team member] --> Web[React + TypeScript web app]
  Web -->|HTTP / JSON| API[FastAPI API]
  API --> DB[(PostgreSQL)]
  API -->|enqueue jobs| Redis[(Redis broker)]
  Redis --> Worker[Celery worker]
  Worker --> DB
  Worker --> Gateway[LLM Gateway]
  Gateway --> GH[GitHub Models]
  Gateway --> Ollama[Ollama]
  Gateway --> Custom[OpenAI-compatible provider]
  Worker --> Connector[Connector + trace normalization]
  API --> Connector
  Connector --> App[Supported app under test]
  Connector -. gated / unverified types .-> Unsupported[Docker / Git / CLI / Proxy / Website / MCP]
